// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 3
window.T3_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"acceptable – connection","cards":[{"w":"acceptable","p":"adj.","d":"able to be agreed on or approved of; satisfactory","c":"可接受的；令人滿意的","s":"The boss did not find Connie's late report acceptable at all, so she had to redo the entire analysis.","t":"老闆完全不認為康妮遲交的報告是可接受的，因此她必須將整份分析重做。"},{"w":"accept","p":"v.","d":"to consent to receive something offered; to believe or come to recognize","c":"接受；答應；承認（動詞）","s":"After thinking about the job offer for several days, Henry decided to accept the attractive position in New York.","t":"在考慮這份工作機會數天之後，亨利決定接受位於紐約的這個吸引人的職位。"},{"w":"acceptance","p":"n.","d":"the action of consenting to receive or undertake something; approval","c":"接受；認同；錄取通知（不可數/可數）","s":"David jumped with immense excitement when he opened the official letter of acceptance from Harvard University.","t":"當大衛拆開哈佛大學正式的錄取通知信時，他興奮得跳了起來。"},{"w":"ache","p":"n.","d":"a continuous or prolonged dull pain in a part of one's body","c":"隱隱作痛；持續鈍痛（可數）","s":"After working for eight hours without a break, the computer programmer felt a painful ache in his lower back.","t":"在連續工作八小時沒有休息後，電腦程式設計師感到下背部一陣劇烈的疼痛／酸痛。"},{"w":"ache","p":"v.","d":"to suffer from a continuous dull pain; to feel intense desire or longing","c":"疼痛；酸痛；極度渴望（動詞）","s":"My grandmother's joints always begin to ache whenever the winter weather turns very cold and humid.","t":"每當冬季天氣變得非常寒冷潮濕時，我祖母的關節總是開始隱隱作痛。"},{"w":"breath","p":"n.","d":"the air inhaled and exhaled in respiration (uncountable/countable)","c":"呼吸；氣息；一口氣（不可數/可數）","s":"After running all the way to the top of the steep hill, Jim stopped to catch his breath.","t":"一路狂奔到陡峭山頂之後，吉姆停下來喘口氣／歇歇腳。"},{"w":"breathe","p":"v.","d":"to take air into the lungs and expel it; to be alive","c":"呼吸；吸入（動詞）","s":"The frightened audience could hardly breathe during the most terrifying climax scene of the horror movie.","t":"在恐怖電影最驚悚的高潮場景中，嚇壞的觀眾幾乎無法呼吸。"},{"w":"cart","p":"n.","d":"a small wheeled vehicle pushed or pulled by hand or beast","c":"手推車；採購推車；馬車（可數）","s":"Patrick filled his shopping cart with fresh fruits, milk, and bread as he walked around the supermarket.","t":"派翠克在超市逛街時，把新鮮水果、牛奶和麵包裝滿了他的購物推車。"},{"w":"cart","p":"v.","d":"to convey or carry something heavy in a cart or vehicle","c":"運送；搬運（動詞）","s":"The strong workers had to cart all the broken wooden furniture out of the old house before the movers arrived.","t":"在搬家工人到達之前，強壯的工人必須把所有損壞的木製家具從老房子中搬運走。"},{"w":"cattle","p":"n.","d":"large domesticated animals with horns and hooves, kept on farms for meat or milk","c":"牛群；牲口（集合名詞，複數動詞）","s":"The hardworking cowboy was responsible for guiding a large herd of cattle across the river to green pastures.","t":"那位勤勞的牛仔負責引導一大群牛群過河前往綠色牧場。"},{"w":"chimney","p":"n.","d":"a vertical channel or pipe that carries smoke up from a fireplace through a roof","c":"煙囪（可數）","s":"Thick grey smoke rose high into the winter sky from the stone chimney of the mountain cottage.","t":"濃濃的灰煙從山間小屋的石造煙囪升向高高的冬日天空。"},{"w":"collection","p":"n.","d":"a group of objects collected together, or a fashion season line","c":"收藏品；系列商品；募集（可數/不可數）","s":"Brenda is an enthusiastic music lover who owns an impressive CD collection spanning over four decades.","t":"布蘭達是一位狂熱的音樂愛好者，擁有令人驚嘆、跨越四十年的 CD收藏品。"},{"w":"collect","p":"v.","d":"to bring together things from various places; to accumulate","c":"收集；聚集；領取（動詞）","s":"As a passionate hobby, young Timmy loves to collect colorful stamps from countries all around the globe.","t":"作為一項充滿熱情的嗜好，年輕的提姆喜歡收集來自全球各國的彩色郵票。"},{"w":"collector","p":"n.","d":"a person who collects things of a specified type, professionally or as a hobby","c":"收藏家；收集者；收費員（可數）","s":"A wealthy art collector purchased the rare oil painting at the international auction for five million dollars.","t":"一位富有的藝術收藏家在國際拍賣會上以五百萬美元買下了那幅珍稀油畫。"},{"w":"connect","p":"v.","d":"to join together so as to provide access or communication","c":"連結；接通；聯絡（動詞）","s":"You must connect the black power cable to the wall socket before you turn on the computer monitor.","t":"在打開電腦螢幕之前，你必須先將黑色電源線連接至牆壁插座。"},{"w":"connection","p":"n.","d":"a relationship in which a person, thing, or idea is linked with something else","c":"關聯；人脈；轉乘連線（可數/不可數）","s":"The students could not join the online classroom because their rural home suffered from a poor internet connection.","t":"學生們無法加入線上課堂，因為他們鄉村的家面臨不佳的網際網路連線。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"decade – impressive","cards":[{"w":"decade","p":"n.","d":"a period of ten consecutive years","c":"十年（可數）","s":"Charlie has lived and worked in southern France for over a decade since moving abroad in 2012.","t":"自 2012 年移居國外以來，查理在法國南部生活與工作了超過十年。"},{"w":"democracy","p":"n.","d":"a system of government by the whole population or eligible members of a state","c":"民主；民主政治；民主體制（不可數/可數）","s":"Citizens who have never experienced military dictatorship often take their freedom and democracy for granted.","t":"從未經歷過軍事獨裁統治的公民，常常將他們的自由與民主視為理所當然。"},{"w":"democratic","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or supporting democracy or its principles","c":"民主的；有民主作風的","s":"South Africa officially became a truly democratic nation with equal rights for all races in the mid-1990s.","t":"南非在 1990 年代中期正式成為一個所有種族享有平等權利的真正民主的國家。"},{"w":"educate","p":"v.","d":"to give intellectual, moral, and social instruction to someone","c":"教育；培養；教導（動詞）","s":"Parents and school teachers should educate young children about being kind and compassionate to domestic animals.","t":"父母與學校老師應當教育教導年幼孩子要對家養動物友善且有愛心。"},{"w":"education","p":"n.","d":"the process of receiving or giving systematic instruction, especially at a school or university","c":"教育；教育學（不可數/可數）","s":"Investing heavily in early childhood education is the most effective way for any developing country to eliminate poverty.","t":"大量投資幼兒教育是任何開發中國家消除貧困最有效的途徑。"},{"w":"educational","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the provision of education, or providing useful knowledge","c":"具教育意義的；教育的","s":"Francis enjoys watching an educational television documentary every weekend to expand his knowledge of world history.","t":"法蘭西斯每週末喜歡觀看具教育意義的電視紀錄片，以擴充他對世界歷史的知識。"},{"w":"emergency","p":"n.","d":"a serious, unexpected, and often dangerous situation requiring immediate action","c":"緊急情況；突發事件；急診（可數）","s":"When the elderly man collapsed suddenly on the busy train, passengers quickly rushed him to the nearest hospital emergency room.","t":"當那名老人在繁忙的火車上突然倒下時，乘客們迅速將他送往最近的醫院急診室。"},{"w":"erase","p":"v.","d":"to rub out or remove writing; to eliminate from memory or a hard drive","c":"擦掉；抹去；消除（動詞）","s":"The inexperienced intern accidentally erased confidential client data from the main company server by pressing the wrong key.","t":"那位缺乏經驗的實習生按錯了鍵，意外從公司主伺服器中抹除／擦掉了機密客戶資料。"},{"w":"eraser","p":"n.","d":"a piece of rubber or other material used to remove marks made by pencil or chalk","c":"橡皮擦；板擦（可數）","s":"The little girl used a pink rubber eraser to fix the spelling mistake in her English diary.","t":"小女孩用一塊粉紅色的橡皮擦修正了她英文日記中的拼寫錯誤。"},{"w":"flood","p":"n.","d":"an overflowing of a large amount of water beyond its normal confines over dry land","c":"水災；洪水；氾濫（可數/不可數）","s":"Residents living near the swelling river feared that the torrential summer downpours would cause a devastating flood.","t":"住在暴漲河流附近的居民擔心，夏季傾盆豪雨會引發毀滅性的水災／洪水。"},{"w":"flood","p":"v.","d":"to cover or submerge with water; to arrive in overwhelming amounts","c":"淹沒；湧入；淹水（動詞）","s":"Rising sea tides and heavy monsoon rain began to flood the low-lying coastal streets throughout the night.","t":"暴漲的海潮與強烈的季風降雨整夜開始淹沒沿海低窪街道。"},{"w":"holder","p":"n.","d":"a device for holding something; a person possessing a title, record, or ticket","c":"持有人；固定器；置物架（可數）","s":"Nicole is the proud world record holder in weightlifting for her age category after lifting 120 kilograms.","t":"在舉起 120 公斤之後，妮可成為了她年齡組別中舉重項目驕傲的世界紀錄保持人。"},{"w":"impress","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel admiration and respect; to imprint deeply","c":"使欽佩；留下深刻印象（動詞）","s":"Carla truly impressed the entire hiring committee with her fluent spoken French and confident professional demeanor.","t":"卡拉以其流利的法語口說和自信沉穩的專業舉止，著實讓整個招聘委員會留下了深刻深刻的好印象。"},{"w":"impression","p":"n.","d":"an idea, feeling, or opinion about someone or something, formed without conscious thought","c":"印象；觀感；感覺（可數/不可數）","s":"Dressing in clean, professional business attire helps candidates make a great first impression during formal job interviews.","t":"在正式求職面試中，穿著乾淨專業的商務服裝有助於求職者留下極佳的第一印象。"},{"w":"impressive","p":"adj.","d":"evoking admiration through size, quality, skill, or importance","c":"令人讚嘆的；令人佩服的；令人印象深刻的","s":"The self-taught young violinist delivered a highly impressive performance that brought the entire audience to its feet.","t":"那位自學成才的年輕小提琴家發表了極其令人讚嘆佩服的演出，讓全場觀眾起立致敬。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"juicy – pitch in","cards":[{"w":"juicy","p":"adj.","d":"full of juice; succulent; exciting and interesting","c":"多汁的；八卦刺激的","s":"Victor grilled a thick and juicy steak over hot charcoal for our outdoor summer family barbecue.","t":"維克多在熱木炭上烤了一塊厚實且多汁的牛排，供我們夏季戶外家庭烤肉享用。"},{"w":"jungle","p":"n.","d":"an area of land overgrown with dense forest and tangled vegetation","c":"叢林；密林；熱帶叢林（可數/不可數）","s":"An ancient tribal legend tells of a magnificent golden temple hidden deep inside the Amazon jungle.","t":"一個古老的部落傳說講述了一座隱藏在亞馬遜叢林深處的宏偉黃金神廟。"},{"w":"junk","p":"n.","d":"old or discarded articles that are considered useless or of little value","c":"廢棄雜物；破爛；垃圾（不可數）","s":"Eating salty and sugary junk food every single day can lead to serious cardiovascular problems in young adults.","t":"每天食用高鹽高糖的垃圾食物可能導致年輕人嚴重心血管問題。"},{"w":"kangaroo","p":"n.","d":"a large Australian marsupial with powerful hind legs for leaping and a pouch","c":"袋鼠（可數）","s":"While playing golf on a famous course near Sydney, tourists were delighted to see a wild kangaroo hopping across the grass.","t":"在雪梨附近著名的球場打高爾夫球時，遊客們高興地看到一隻野生袋鼠跳過草坪。"},{"w":"march","p":"v.","d":"to walk with stiff, regular, and measured strides, like soldiers","c":"行軍；齊步前進；遊行抗議（動詞）","s":"Thousands of passionate environmental activists gathered to march through city streets against government climate policies.","t":"數千名熱情的環保倡議者聚集在一起，穿過城市街道遊行抗議政府的氣候政策。"},{"w":"march","p":"n.","d":"an act of marching; a long walk; a musical composition with a strong rhythm","c":"遊行；長途跋涉；進行曲（可數）","s":"Over ten thousand peaceful citizens joined the public protest march downtown to demand higher wages and fair labor laws.","t":"超過一萬名和平公民參加了市中心的公開抗議遊行，要求提高工資與公平勞動法。"},{"w":"neighborhood","p":"n.","d":"a district, especially one forming a community within a town or city","c":"街坊；鄰近地區；社區（可數）","s":"Our quiet residential neighborhood has a wonderful public library, clean playgrounds, and several cozy family-owned cafes.","t":"我們安靜的住宅社區擁有一座極佳的公共圖書館、乾淨的遊樂場以及幾家溫馨的家族咖啡館。"},{"w":"neighbor","p":"n.","d":"a person living next door to or very near to the speaker or person referred to","c":"鄰居；鄰國（可數）","s":"Whenever we travel out of town for vacations, our friendly next-door neighbor kindly waters our garden flowers.","t":"每當我們出城度假時，我們親切的隔壁鄰居都會好心替我們澆灌花園的花朵。"},{"w":"nest","p":"n.","d":"a structure or place made or chosen by a bird for laying eggs and sheltering its young","c":"鳥巢；窩；巢穴（可數）","s":"During early spring, hundreds of wild swallows arrive at the park to build their mud nests under the bridge.","t":"在初春時節，數百隻野生燕子抵達公園，在橋樑下建造牠們的泥巢。"},{"w":"nest","p":"v.","d":"to use or build a nest; to fit an object inside a larger one","c":"築巢；棲息；套疊（動詞）","s":"Many rare species of seabirds travel thousands of miles to nest safely among the protected island mangroves.","t":"許多稀有海鳥物種飛行數千英里，在受保護的島嶼紅樹林中安全築巢棲息。"},{"w":"pitch","p":"n.","d":"the highness or lowness of a tone; a playing field; a promotional speech","c":"音高；球場；推銷說詞；投球（可數/不可數）","s":"The talented opera singer can effortlessly hit the highest vocal pitch of any classical Italian melody.","t":"那位才華洋溢的歌劇歌手能毫不費力地唱出任何古典義大利旋律的最高音調／音高。"},{"w":"pitch","p":"v.","d":"to throw or fling roughly; to set up a tent","c":"投球；投擲；搭帳篷（動詞）","s":"Ray trained hard every afternoon because he was chosen to pitch for his high school varsity baseball team.","t":"雷每天下午刻苦訓練，因為他被選入代表他的高中棒球校隊投球／擔任投手。"},{"w":"pitch in","p":"v.phr.","d":"to join in and help with a job or contribute to a cause","c":"投入幫忙；共同分擔／出錢協力","s":"If all four group members pitch in to complete the science project, we will definitely finish before the Friday deadline.","t":"如果四位組員全都同心協力投入幫忙完成這項科學專案，我們一定能在週五截止日前完工。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"practical – scare","cards":[{"w":"practical","p":"adj.","d":"of or concerned with the actual doing or use of something rather than theory","c":"實際的；實用的；切合實際的","s":"Moving to a smaller apartment near the subway station is a very practical way to save monthly living expenses.","t":"搬到靠近捷運站的小公寓，是節省每月生活開銷非常實際實用的方式。"},{"w":"impractical","p":"adj.","d":"not adapted for use or action; not sensible or realistic","c":"不切實際的；不實用的","s":"Wearing high-heeled luxury shoes on a rocky mountain hike is completely impractical and potentially dangerous for your ankles.","t":"穿著高跟奢華名牌鞋在崎嶇山路上健行完全是不切實際的，而且對你的腳踝具有潛在危險。"},{"w":"practice","p":"n.","d":"the actual application of an idea, belief, or method; regular training","c":"實踐；練習；慣例（不可數/可數）","s":"The innovative environmental plan sounds wonderful on paper, but it is extremely difficult to put into daily practice.","t":"這項創新的環保計畫在紙面上聽起來很棒，但在日常生活中要付諸實行卻極為困難。"},{"w":"presence","p":"n.","d":"the state or fact of existing, occurring, or being present in a place","c":"出席；在場；存在感；儀態風範（不可數）","s":"Kevin returned to the team after missing three consecutive games, and his commanding presence was felt on the court right away.","t":"在缺席了三場連續比賽之後，凱文重返球隊，他在球場上威風凜凜的在場／存在感立刻顯露無遺。"},{"w":"present","p":"adj.","d":"in a particular place; existing or occurring now (/ˈprez.ənt/)","c":"在場的；出席的；目前的（形容詞）","s":"All parents were warmly invited to be present at the annual elementary school graduation ceremony this morning.","t":"今天上午所有家長都受到熱情邀請出席／在場年度小學畢業典禮。"},{"w":"pub","p":"n.","d":"an establishment licensed to serve alcoholic drinks traditionally in Britain and Ireland","c":"酒館；英式酒吧（可數）","s":"After finishing a long week of demanding factory work, Aaron joined some close neighbors at the corner pub for a pint of beer.","t":"在辛苦結束了一整週繁重的工廠工作後，亞倫和幾位親近的鄰居在街角的英式酒館碰面喝了杯啤酒。"},{"w":"pump","p":"n.","d":"a mechanical device using suction or pressure to raise or move liquids or gases","c":"抽水機；幫浦；打氣筒（可數）","s":"The soccer ball was completely flat and would be much easier to fill up if we had a portable bicycle air pump.","t":"足球完全消氣了，如果我們有一個手提式自行車打氣筒，充氣就會容易得多。"},{"w":"pump","p":"v.","d":"to force liquid or gas to move; to supply in large quantities","c":"抽取；打氣；大力灌注（動詞）","s":"The powerful industrial machine will continuously pump in fresh mountain air and suck out the humid, stale air.","t":"強大的工業機器將持續抽入新鮮山區空氣，並抽離潮濕污濁的空氣。"},{"w":"rag","p":"n.","d":"a piece of old cloth, especially one used for cleaning or wiping","c":"破布；抹布；破舊衣服（可數）","s":"Jonathan picked up a damp cotton rag and thoroughly wiped off the sticky dust covering his bedroom closet shelves.","t":"強納森拿起一塊潮濕的棉質抹布，徹底擦掉覆蓋在他臥室衣櫥架上的黏稠灰塵。"},{"w":"reduce","p":"v.","d":"to make smaller or less in amount, degree, or size","c":"減少；降低；減縮（動詞）","s":"If your family can reduce unnecessary entertainment spending now, you will save enough money for an overseas summer vacation.","t":"如果你的家庭現在能縮減不必要的娛樂開銷，你們就能存下足夠的錢去海外度暑假。"},{"w":"reduction","p":"n.","d":"the action or fact of making something smaller or less in amount, degree, or size","c":"減少；降低；折價（可數/不可數）","s":"The department store offered a thirty percent price reduction on all winter coats during the annual clearance sale.","t":"百貨公司在年度出清特賣期間，對所有冬季大衣提供了三成的降價折扣。"},{"w":"satisfactory","p":"adj.","d":"fulfilling expectations or needs; acceptable though not outstanding","c":"令人滿意的；符合要求的","s":"The comprehensive clinical trial results of the new allergy medicine were considered highly satisfactory by international medical regulators.","t":"新過敏藥物的全面臨床試驗結果被國際醫學監管機構認為是高度令人滿意的。"},{"w":"satisfy","p":"v.","d":"to meet the expectations, needs, or desires of someone","c":"使滿意；滿足（動詞）","s":"Eating a warm bowl of beef noodle soup was more than enough to satisfy his hunger after the long journey.","t":"在漫長旅途之後，吃上一碗熱騰騰的牛肉麵足以滿足／充飢他的飢餓感。"},{"w":"satisfaction","p":"n.","d":"fulfillment of one's wishes, expectations, or needs, or the pleasure derived from this","c":"滿意；滿足感（不可數）","s":"The talented young carpenter smiled with a deep sense of satisfaction after finishing the handcrafted dining room table.","t":"那位才華洋溢的年輕木匠在完成手工餐桌後，帶著深深的成就滿足感露出了微笑。"},{"w":"scary","p":"adj.","d":"frightening; causing fear","c":"可怕的；嚇人的；駭人的","s":"The scary horror movie made little Nathan hide under his thick wool blanket and shake with fright.","t":"那部可怕駭人的恐怖電影讓年幼的奈森躲在厚羊毛毯底下嚇得發抖。"},{"w":"scare","p":"v.","d":"to cause great fear or nervousness in someone; to frighten","c":"驚嚇；使害怕；受驚（動詞）","s":"The farmer placed a large straw scarecrow in the cornfield to scare away noisy crows from pecking his crops.","t":"農夫在玉米田裡放置了一個大型稻草人，以嚇跑啄食他農作物的喧鬧烏鴉。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"scissors – varied","cards":[{"w":"scissors","p":"n.","d":"an instrument used for cutting cloth, paper, and other thin material (plural noun)","c":"剪刀（恆用複數，可數搭配 a pair of）","s":"In art and craft class, the elementary students carefully used a pair of rounded safety scissors to cut colorful paper shapes.","t":"在美勞工藝課上，小學生們小心翼翼地使用一把圓頭安全剪刀來剪裁色彩繽紛的紙形。"},{"w":"solid","p":"adj.","d":"firm and stable in shape; dependable; continuous without a break","c":"固體的；堅固穩定的；可靠的；純粹的","s":"When pure fresh water gets down below zero degrees Celsius, it rapidly turns into cold solid ice.","t":"當純淨的淡水溫度降至攝氏零度以下時，它會迅速轉變為冰冷的固體冰塊。"},{"w":"solid","p":"n.","d":"a substance or object that is solid rather than liquid or fluid","c":"固體；固態食物（可數/不可數）","s":"When Martha was severely ill with stomach pain in the hospital, she could not digest any solid and drank only warm broth.","t":"當瑪莎因胃痛在醫院病重時，她無法消化任何固態食物，只能喝溫高湯。"},{"w":"solidarity","p":"n.","d":"unity or agreement of feeling or action, especially among individuals with a common interest","c":"團結；團結一致（不可數）","s":"Thousands of factory workers marched through downtown streets to show complete solidarity with their striking coal miner colleagues.","t":"數千名工廠工人走上市中心街頭遊行，表達對罷工煤礦工人同僚的全力團結支持。"},{"w":"steal","p":"v.","d":"to take another person's property without permission or legal right","c":"偷竊；暗中奪取；偷偷移動（動詞）","s":"The masked burglar quietly entered the dark gallery and attempted to steal a precious diamond necklace from the glass display.","t":"蒙面竊賊悄悄潛入黑暗的展廳，試圖從玻璃展示櫃中偷走一條珍貴的鑽石項鍊。"},{"w":"steal","p":"n.","d":"a bargain, or something obtained at a remarkably low price","c":"極便宜之物；超划算的交易（可數）","s":"At only twenty dollars for this genuine vintage leather jacket, buying it at the weekend garage sale was an absolute steal.","t":"這件真正的復古真皮夾克只要二十美元，在週末跳蚤市場買下它絕對是極度划算便宜的交易。"},{"w":"tender","p":"adj.","d":"showing gentleness and concern; easy to cut or chew; sensitive to pain","c":"溫柔的；柔嫩的；稚嫩的；觸痛的","s":"The chef roasted the garlic chicken so skillfully that the skin was golden crispy on the outside and wonderfully tender on the inside.","t":"主廚烤大蒜雞的技藝如此高超，外皮呈現金黃酥脆，而內部肉質則極為柔嫩。"},{"w":"variety","p":"n.","d":"the quality or state of being different or diverse; a number of different types","c":"多樣性；變化；種類；品種（不可數/可數）","s":"The local morning farmers market always offers a wide variety of fresh organic vegetables, fruits, and homemade cheeses.","t":"當地的清晨農夫市集始終提供各式各樣／琳瑯滿目的新鮮有機蔬菜、水果和自製乳酪。"},{"w":"various","p":"adj.","d":"more than one; several different types","c":"各式各樣的；不同的","s":"Doug enthusiastically participates in various outdoor sports with his friends, but he still enjoys soccer and tennis the best.","t":"道格熱情地與朋友們參與各式各樣不同的戶外運動，但他依然最喜歡足球和網球。"},{"w":"vary","p":"v.","d":"to differ in size, amount, degree, or nature from something else","c":"改變；呈現不同；變化（動詞）","s":"The daily temperatures in this desert valley can vary widely from scorching hot during the day to freezing cold at night.","t":"這座沙漠山谷的日常氣溫變化極大，從白天的炙熱高溫到夜晚的冰冷刺骨各有不同。"},{"w":"varied","p":"adj.","d":"incorporating a number of different types or elements; diverse","c":"形形色色的；多變的；豐富多樣的","s":"Throughout his long and varied career as an international journalist, Mr. Adams reported on wars, arts, and scientific discoveries.","t":"在他漫長且豐富多彩的國際記者職業生涯中，亞當斯先生報導過戰爭、藝術以及科學發現。"}]}];
